# Backend workspace

- Entry: `index.js`. Routes mount at `/api` via `routes/index.js`.
- Middleware: `tokenvalidate.js`, `organisationvalidate.js`, `cronvalidate.js`.
- Do not break clients: web and mobile depend on current paths and response shapes.
- Prefer Sequelize models in `models/`; migrations via project npm scripts.
- Full docs: `backend/docs/`.
- See also root `.cursor/rules/backend.mdc` patterns.
